


Core Diagnostic Query: View Active Queries

Who is running queries right now
Which queries are long-running
What those queries are doing (text + wait state)
Source: https://medium.com/@jramcloud1/monitoring-active-queries-in-postgresql-real-time-performance-diagnostics-using-pg-stat-activity-cd707a42aee7

SELECT pid,
       usename,
       datname,
       client_addr,
       application_name,
       state,
       wait_event_type,
       wait_event,
       backend_start,
       query_start,
       now() - query_start AS runtime,
       query
FROM pg_stat_activity
WHERE state = 'active'
ORDER BY runtime DESC;

